   'procedure', 'national', '2026-10-13'::date, 'active',
   'Model AA9/12 filing channels (PEC, office appointment, registered mail) and 30-day deadline from start of activity; mentions fiscal representative case for non-EU/EEA non-residents. Nomad only (decree Art. 6.2).', array['partita-iva']::text[]),
  ('it-ade-partita-iva-aa9', array['italy_digital_nomad']::text[], 'IT', 'Partita Iva persone fisiche (AA9/12) – che cos''è', 'Agenzia delle Entrate',
